1-49a6-a89f-8af093e3aeb9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7fdf2a10863727b1f74b28e3f77d3fb6, https://si.imgix.net/2485f847/uploads/origins/b6a202d0-6951-49a6-a89f-8af093e3aeb9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0a7b2f8bc9dc06a1a503997b00db489b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2485f847/uploads/origins/b6a202d0-6951-49a6-a89f-8af093e3aeb9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8b207426e4de79251a9188aa565e1f1a 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2485f847/uploads/origins/b6a202d0-6951-49a6-a89f-8af093e3aeb9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d0e8995872a4528dd63c596df6a6ba6e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2485f847/uploads/origins/b6a202d0-6951-49a6-a89f-8af093e3aeb9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d0e8995872a4528dd63c596df6a6ba6e, https://si.imgix.net/2485f847/uploads/origins/b6a202d0-6951-49a6-a89f-8af093e3aeb9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=16329b92d1400c0a0e1c25a8c52c92b6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2485f847/uploads/origins/b6a202d0-6951-49a6-a89f-8af093e3aeb9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1df7cc6ce8be343f1145b180766ff053 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I love your art. I'd like to request my gardevoir named Saikikku with Serena from Pokemon X & Y. Saikikku is a mega shiny gardevoir who is male. Here is a quick reference for their designs: https://files.catbox.moe/c0bdkb.jpg \n\nHere are some arts I've commissioned before for Saikikku: https://imgur.com/a/saikikku-references-AjyY4pP\n\nFor the art request, I'd like Saikikku to be standing directly behind Serena and hugging her.\n He stands a good head taller than her and the two are smiling and facing the viewer.\n Serena is innocent and pure but also a bit shy. \nMeanwhile, Saikikku is smirking and a lot more cocky. \nSaikikku's arms are wrapped over Serena's chest, and his hands are forming a heart shape.\nThere is a heart glowing in the center, and is the same color as Saikikku's eyes. They are a mix of bright yellow and fiery orange\n\nIf possible, can you make an alt version where Serena's blue eyes are changed, and she has a slightly dopier and smug smile. The implication being that she is Saikikku's pet.\n\nI don't have an exact reference for the pose, but I do wish for something like this: https://files.catbox.moe/bhdahs.jpg\nThank you!", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@suahh_31/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2813297, "client_id": 962375, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a189f6c6/uploads/origins/9e19383d-4979-4fb4-9291-58c748bfb73b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=75d232d5f9b5d3b0984076ddc5d753ea", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a189f6c6/uploads/origins/9e19383d-4979-4fb4-9291-58c748bfb73b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=75d232d5f9b5d3b0984076ddc5d753ea, https://si.imgix.net/a189f6c6/uploads/origins/9e19383d-4979-4fb4-9291-58c748bfb73b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=61830e175adddba6cea6f24c59072a04 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a189f6c6/uploads/origins/9e19383d-4979-4fb4-9291-58c748bfb73b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f2777300bf0598867b20f1253c46be5a 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a189f6c6/uploads/origins/9e19383d-4979-4fb4-9291-58c748bfb73b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0a2b616fdf9d713a38310ab02c7bd3ed", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a189f6c6/uploads/origins/9e19383d-4979-4fb4-9291-58c748bfb73b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0a2b616fdf9d713a38310ab02c7bd3ed, https://si.imgix.net/a189f6c6/uploads/origins/9e19383d-4979-4fb4-9291-58c748bfb73b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=00f25c7b667ee79f7d3b1fbc678f7fef 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a189f6c6/uploads/origins/9e19383d-4979-4fb4-9291-58c748bfb73b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=dc14a21173771c5be9b865078cfb4f17 3x"}, "body": "\"こんにちは、クトゥルフ神話TRPGに使用するイラスト(全身立ち絵)をリクエストしたいです。\nよろしくお願いします。\n\n使用は個人利用に限り、商用利用はありません。\n使用時は背景を透過させたイラストになります。\n貴方の絵がとても好きなので、指定のない部分はお任せします。\n\n以下がキャラクターの詳細になります。\"\n年齢：18\n性別：女性\n血液型：O\n\n職業：専門学生(ファッション系)\n\nSTR(筋　力)[3D6/MAX18]：10\nCON(体　力)[3D6/MAX18]：11\nPOW(精神力)[3D6/MAX18]：13\nDEX(敏捷性)[3D6/MAX18]：15\nAPP(魅　力)[3D6/MAX18]：16\nSIZ(体　格)[2D6+6/MAX18]：16\nINT(知　能)[2D6+6/MAX18]：14\nEDU(教　養)[3D6+3/MAX21]：12\n\n身長：171cm(高め)\n体格：モデル体型\n\nメインの性格：横柄\nサブの性格1：女々しい\n\nキャラクターイメージ\nファッション雑誌や映えるスポットに真っ先に行き、SNSにアップする。\nキラキラしている。\n\nイメージカラー：6363EA\n\"イメージカラーとしていますが、差し色や小物、服などに似た色を取り入れていただければ幸いです。\n(もちろん、メインカラーとして頂いても構いません。)\"\n\n服装イメージ\nスレンダーな体系を活かし、シンプルかつ体のラインを活かすようなものです\nhttps://i.imgur.com/QJ5Aw1s.png\n\n顔の特徴：キツネ顔\n表　情：ちょっと小馬鹿にする感じが良いです\n髪　色：イメージカラー、もしくは黒\n髪　型：ロング\n\nポーズ・構図：お任せします\n\n世界観：現代\n\n以上になります、よろしくお願いします。", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@suahh_31/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2813297, "client_id": 2761330, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b263861b/uploads/origins/458c2849-e382-40be-b862-dacaee6d5aef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b24c8ee413864a7264909a2b799586c2", "srcset": "https://si.im